<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PathKeeper | Grants & Creator Funding Resources</title>

<style>
:root{
  --cream:#F7F2E8;
  --cream2:#EEE3D1;
  --cream3:#E2D2B9;
  --brown:#49352A;
  --brown2:#674C3B;
  --brown3:#8B6A50;
  --blue:#294F6D;
  --blue2:#3D6F91;
  --blue3:#729BB5;
  --blue-light:#DCEAF1;
  --green:#54745B;
  --white:#FFFEFA;
  --text:#302820;
  --muted:#71675D;
  --border:#D6C8B5;
  --shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(73,53,42,.09);
}

*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}

body{
  background:var(--cream);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
  line-height:1.6;
}

button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}

.page{
  max-width:1200px;
  margin:auto;
  background:var(--cream);
  overflow:hidden;
}

.topbar{
  padding:18px 5%;
  background:var(--brown);
  color:var(--cream);
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
  gap:15px;
}

.brand{
  font-size:.85rem;
  font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:.08em;
}

.brand span{color:var(--blue-light)}

.top-note{
  font-size:.72rem;
  color:var(--cream2);
}

.hero{
  padding:70px 7%;
  color:var(--cream);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 90% 15%,rgba(114,155,181,.25),transparent 30%),
    linear-gradient(120deg,var(--blue),var(--brown));
}

.eyebrow{
  color:var(--cream3);
  font-size:.72rem;
  font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:.13em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  margin-bottom:15px;
}

.hero h1{
  max-width:850px;
  font-size:clamp(2.3rem,6vw,4.4rem);
  line-height:1.05;
  letter-spacing:-.045em;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero h1 span{color:var(--blue-light)}

.hero p{
  max-width:760px;
  color:#F0E8DC;
  font-size:1rem;
  line-height:1.8;
}

.hero-note{
  display:inline-block;
  margin-top:25px;
  padding:9px 14px;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);
  border-radius:8px;
  color:var(--cream);
  font-size:.76rem;
}

.hero-actions{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:12px;
  margin-top:25px;
}

.hero-button{
  display:inline-block;
  text-decoration:none;
  padding:13px 19px;
  border-radius:8px;
  background:var(--cream);
  color:var(--blue);
  font-size:.82rem;
  font-weight:900;
  border:1px solid var(--cream);
  transition:.2s;
}

.hero-button:hover{
  background:var(--blue-light);
  transform:translateY(-2px);
}

.hero-button.secondary-link{
  background:transparent;
  color:var(--cream);
  border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);
}

.hero-button.secondary-link:hover{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);
}

.nav{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:8px;
  padding:16px 5%;
  background:var(--white);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}

.nav a{
  color:var(--blue);
  text-decoration:none;
  font-size:.75rem;
  font-weight:800;
  padding:8px 11px;
  border-radius:6px;
}

.nav a:hover{background:var(--blue-light)}

.section{
  padding:55px 6%;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}

.section.alt{background:#F0E8DA}

.section.dark{
  background:var(--brown);
  color:var(--cream);
}

.section-heading{
  max-width:780px;
  margin-bottom:28px;
}

.kicker{
  color:var(--blue2);
  font-size:.7rem;
  font-weight:900;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:.12em;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

.dark .kicker{color:#BBD6E5}

.section-heading h2{
  color:var(--brown);
  font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.6rem);
  line-height:1.15;
  margin-bottom:12px;
}

.dark .section-heading h2{color:var(--cream)}

.section-heading p{
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.9rem;
}

.dark .section-heading p{color:#E3D7C8}

.grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:15px;
}

.card{
  background:var(--white);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:13px;
  padding:22px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.card h3{
  color:var(--brown);
  font-size:1rem;
  margin-bottom:9px;
}

.card p{
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.82rem;
}

.card .number{
  color:var(--blue2);
  font-size:1.65rem;
  font-weight:900;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

.callout{
  background:var(--blue-light);
  border-left:4px solid var(--blue2);
  padding:17px 20px;
  border-radius:8px;
  margin-top:20px;
  color:var(--brown);
  font-size:.84rem;
}

.callout strong{color:var(--blue)}

.two-col{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:18px;
  align-items:start;
}

.panel{
  background:var(--white);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:13px;
  padding:23px;
}

.panel h3{
  color:var(--brown);
  margin-bottom:8px;
  font-size:1rem;
}

.panel-intro{
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.8rem;
  margin-bottom:18px;
}

label{
  display:block;
  color:var(--brown);
  font-size:.76rem;
  font-weight:800;
  margin-bottom:6px;
}

.field{margin-bottom:15px}

.input,.select,.textarea{
  width:100%;
  background:#FFFEFA;
  color:var(--text);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:7px;
  padding:11px 12px;
  outline:none;
  font-size:.82rem;
}

.textarea{min-height:105px;resize:vertical}

.input:focus,.select:focus,.textarea:focus{
  border-color:var(--blue2);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(61,111,145,.12);
}

.form-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:13px;
}

.full{grid-column:1/-1}

.btn{
  border:0;
  border-radius:7px;
  padding:11px 16px;
  font-size:.78rem;
  font-weight:900;
  transition:.2s;
}

.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}

.primary{background:var(--blue);color:white}
.secondary{background:var(--brown2);color:white}
.light-btn{
  background:var(--blue-light);
  color:var(--blue);
  border:1px solid #B9D0DE;
}
.outline{
  background:transparent;
  color:var(--blue);
  border:1px solid var(--blue3);
}

.button-row{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:9px;
  margin-top:12px;
}

.small-note{
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.72rem;
  margin-top:10px;
}

.result{
  display:none;
  margin-top:18px;
  padding:17px;
  background:var(--blue-light);
  border:1px solid #B9D0DE;
  border-radius:9px;
  color:var(--brown);
  font-size:.82rem;
}

.result h3{margin-bottom:8px}

.receipt{
  background:var(--white);
  border:1px dashed var(--blue2);
  padding:18px;
  border-radius:9px;
  margin-top:15px;
}

.receipt-title{
  color:var(--blue);
  font-size:.7rem;
  letter-spacing:.1em;
  font-weight:900;
  margin-bottom:9px;
}

.receipt p{margin:5px 0;font-size:.8rem}

.opportunity-list{
  display:grid;
  gap:12px;
  margin-top:20px;
}

.opportunity{
  background:var(--white);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:17px;
}

.opportunity-top{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:12px;
  align-items:flex-start;
}

.opportunity h3{
  color:var(--brown);
  font-size:.94rem;
}

.opportunity p{
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.77rem;
  margin-top:5px;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere;
}

.tag{
  display:inline-block;
  padding:4px 8px;
  border-radius:20px;
  background:var(--blue-light);
  color:var(--blue);
  font-size:.65rem;
  font-weight:900;
}

.opportunity-actions{
  display:flex;
  gap:8px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin-top:12px;
}

.opportunity-actions button{
  font-size:.7rem;
  padding:7px 10px;
}

.empty{
  padding:22px;
  border:1px dashed var(--border);
  border-radius:10px;
  color:var(--muted);
  text-align:center;
  font-size:.82rem;
}

.compare-wrap{
  overflow-x:auto;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:11px;
  background:var(--white);
}

table{
  border-collapse:collapse;
  width:100%;
  min-width:650px;
}

th{
  background:var(--blue);
  color:white;
  text-align:left;
  padding:13px;
  font-size:.73rem;
}

td{
  padding:13px;
  border-top:1px solid var(--border);
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.77rem;
  vertical-align:top;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere;
}

td:first-child{
  color:var(--brown);
  font-weight:800;
}

.framework{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:12px;
}

.framework-step{
  padding:18px;
  border-radius:10px;
  background:var(--white);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
}

.framework-step .step{
  color:var(--blue2);
  font-weight:900;
  font-size:.72rem;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}

.framework-step h3{
  color:var(--brown);
  font-size:.9rem;
  margin-bottom:6px;
}

.framework-step p{
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.76rem;
}

.checklist{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:10px;
}

.check-item{
  display:flex;
  gap:10px;
  align-items:flex-start;
  padding:13px;
  background:var(--white);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:8px;
}

.check-item input{
  margin-top:3px;
  accent-color:var(--blue);
}

.check-item label{
  margin:0;
  font-size:.78rem;
  line-height:1.45;
}

.progress-area{margin-bottom:18px}

.progress-top{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:10px;
  margin-bottom:7px;
  color:var(--brown);
  font-size:.75rem;
  font-weight:800;
}

.progress-track{
  height:9px;
  background:var(--cream3);
  border-radius:20px;
  overflow:hidden;
}

.progress-fill{
  height:100%;
  width:0;
  background:var(--green);
  transition:width .25s;
}

.timeline{display:grid;gap:12px}

.timeline-row{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;
  gap:15px;
  padding:15px;
  background:var(--white);
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:9px;
}

.timeline-row strong{
  color:var(--blue);
  font-size:.8rem;
}

.timeline-row p{
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.78rem;
}

.allocation-list{display:grid;gap:13px}

.allocation-row{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 85px 110px;
  gap:10px;
  align-items:center;
}

.allocation-row label{margin:0}
.allocation-row input{width:100%}

.allocation-value{
  text-align:right;
  color:var(--blue);
  font-size:.78rem;
  font-weight:900;
}

.allocation-total{
  margin-top:16px;
  padding:13px;
  background:var(--blue-light);
  border-radius:8px;
  color:var(--brown);
  font-size:.82rem;
  font-weight:900;
}

.preview{
  white-space:pre-wrap;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere;
  max-height:520px;
  overflow:auto;
  padding:18px;
  background:#F0E8DA;
  border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:9px;
  color:var(--brown);
  font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
  font-size:.78rem;
  line-height:1.7;
}

.faq{border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}

.faq-question{
  width:100%;
  text-align:left;
  background:none;
  border:0;
  padding:16px 0;
  color:var(--brown);
  font-size:.84rem;
  font-weight:900;
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:15px;
}

.faq-answer{
  display:none;
  padding:0 25px 17px 0;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.79rem;
}

.faq-item.open .faq-answer{display:block}

.footer{
  background:var(--brown);
  color:var(--cream2);
  padding:30px 6%;
  text-align:center;
  font-size:.75rem;
}

.footer strong{color:white}

.footer a{
  color:var(--blue-light);
  font-weight:900;
  text-decoration:none;
}

.footer a:hover{text-decoration:underline}

@media(max-width:850px){
  .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .framework{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
}

@media(max-width:650px){
  .hero{padding:48px 24px}
  .section{padding:40px 22px}
  .topbar{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}
  .two-col,.grid,.framework,.checklist,.form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .full{grid-column:auto}
  .timeline-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:5px}
  .allocation-row{grid-template-columns:1fr 75px}
  .allocation-value{grid-column:1/-1;text-align:left}
  .nav{gap:3px}
  .nav a{font-size:.69rem}
}

@media print{
  body,.page{background:white}
  .topbar,.hero,.footer{
    print-color-adjust:exact;
    -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;
  }
  .nav,.button-row,.btn,.opportunity-actions,.hero-actions{
    display:none!important;
  }
  .section{break-inside:avoid}
  .card,.panel{box-shadow:none}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="page">

<header class="topbar">
  <div class="brand">PATHKEEPER <span>| FUNDING INTELLIGENCE</span></div>
  <div class="top-note">Research carefully. Compare opportunities. Prepare stronger applications.</div>
</header>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="eyebrow">Grants & Creator Funding Resources</div>

  <h1>Grants & <span>Creator Funding Resources.</span></h1>

  <p>
    "Fund your growth and direct your own learning. Browse curated resources for grants, scholarships, self-education roadmaps, and tools to support independent projects and long-term goals." Find and evaluate grants that match an educational, career, business, or
    community goal. Organize requirements, compare opportunities, calculate
    a realistic funding request, prepare supporting evidence, and build an
    application that responds to what each funder actually asks for.
  </p>

  <div class="hero-note">
    A grant is not just an application. It is a fit assessment, a documented need,
    a budget, and a plan for results.
  </div>

  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a
      class="hero-button"
      href="https://sites.google.com/view/pathkeeper/2-grant-template"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Open Grant Application Template →
    </a>

    <a class="hero-button secondary-link" href="#tracker">
      Start Organizing Funding →
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="nav">
  <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
  <a href="#tracker">Opportunity Tracker</a>
  <a href="#comparison">Compare Grants</a>
  <a href="#framework">Application Framework</a>
  <a href="#readiness">Readiness Checklist</a>
  <a href="#timeline">Timeline</a>
  <a href="#budget">Funding Plan</a>
  <a href="#builder">Proposal Builder</a>
</nav>

<!-- OVERVIEW -->
<section class="section" id="overview">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div class="kicker">Start with the right questions</div>
    <h2>Funding research should lead to a decision—not just a list of links.</h2>
    <p>
      A useful grant research process identifies who can apply, what the funding
      supports, what evidence is required, how much time the application takes,
      and whether the opportunity advances a defined goal.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="number">01</div>
      <h3>Discover</h3>
      <p>Identify funding sources, eligibility conditions, award amounts, deadlines, and permitted uses.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="number">02</div>
      <h3>Evaluate</h3>
      <p>Compare each opportunity against your qualifications, financial need, timeline, and intended outcome.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="number">03</div>
      <h3>Prepare</h3>
      <p>Organize your project description, budget, evidence, supporting documents, and application responses.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="callout">
    <strong>Important:</strong> A grant listing is not proof that funding is currently
    open. Confirm the deadline, eligibility, award terms, and application instructions
    on the funder's official website before preparing or submitting an application.
  </div>

  <div class="callout">
    <strong>Use the companion template:</strong> The
    <a href="https://sites.google.com/view/pathkeeper/2-grant-template"
       target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Grant Application Template page
    </a>
    provides an additional place to review the grant-template material.
  </div>
</section>

<!-- OPPORTUNITY TRACKER -->
<section class="section alt" id="tracker">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div class="kicker">Grant Opportunity Intelligence</div>
    <h2>Create a searchable record of funding opportunities.</h2>
    <p>
      Add grants as you research them. Each entry creates a receipt containing the
      details you recorded. Your saved list can be used to compare options and
      organize your next steps.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="two-col">
    <div class="panel">
      <h3>Opportunity Intake Form</h3>
      <p class="panel-intro">Record the information from the funder's official listing.</p>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="grantName">Grant or Funding Opportunity Name</label>
        <input class="input" id="grantName" placeholder="Enter the opportunity name">
      </div>

      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="grantFunder">Funder / Organization</label>
          <input class="input" id="grantFunder" placeholder="Organization name">
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="grantCategory">Funding Category</label>
          <select class="select" id="grantCategory">
            <option value="">Choose category</option>
            <option>Education / Tuition</option>
            <option>Career Training</option>
            <option>Certification / Exams</option>
            <option>Technology / Equipment</option>
            <option>Business / Startup</option>
            <option>Research / Project</option>
            <option>Community / Nonprofit</option>
            <option>General Financial Assistance</option>
            <option>Other</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="grantAmountInput">Maximum Award Amount ($)</label>
          <input class="input" id="grantAmountInput" type="number" min="0" placeholder="Example: 5000">
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="grantDeadline">Application Deadline</label>
          <input class="input" id="grantDeadline" type="date">
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="grantStatus">Opportunity Status</label>
          <select class="select" id="grantStatus">
            <option>Researching</option>
            <option>Potential Match</option>
            <option>Preparing Application</option>
            <option>Submitted</option>
            <option>Awarded</option>
            <option>Not Eligible</option>
            <option>Closed</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="grantEligibility">Eligibility Result</label>
          <select class="select" id="grantEligibility">
            <option>Not yet verified</option>
            <option>Appears eligible</option>
            <option>Eligibility confirmed</option>
            <option>Not eligible</option>
            <option>Need clarification</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="field full">
          <label for="grantLink">Official Grant Website / Application URL</label>
          <input class="input" id="grantLink" type="url" placeholder="https://">
        </div>

        <div class="field full">
          <label for="grantPurpose">What can the funding pay for?</label>
          <textarea class="textarea" id="grantPurpose"
            placeholder="Record the funder's approved expenses and restrictions."></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="field full">
          <label for="grantRequirements">Important Requirements</label>
          <textarea class="textarea" id="grantRequirements"
            placeholder="Record eligibility, documents, essays, recommendations, budget requirements, and other conditions."></textarea>
        </div>
      </div>

      <button class="btn primary" type="button" onclick="addOpportunity()">
        Save Opportunity & Create Receipt
      </button>

      <div class="small-note">
        Saved entries are stored in this browser on this device. They are not submitted to the funder.
      </div>

      <div class="result" id="receiptResult" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <h3>Opportunity Research Standard</h3>
      <p class="panel-intro">Use this review before treating a listing as a real application option.</p>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-row">
          <strong>Who can apply?</strong>
          <p>Confirm applicant type, location, age, education level, business status, and other eligibility restrictions.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-row">
          <strong>What is funded?</strong>
          <p>Check whether tuition, equipment, fees, supplies, travel, wages, or other costs are permitted.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-row">
          <strong>What is required?</strong>
          <p>Identify essays, budgets, transcripts, references, proof of enrollment, financial records, or project plans.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-row">
          <strong>When is it due?</strong>
          <p>Record the deadline, time zone, submission method, and whether the opportunity is rolling or recurring.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-row">
          <strong>What happens next?</strong>
          <p>Record notification dates, award conditions, payment timing, reporting duties, and follow-up requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top:35px;margin-bottom:15px">
